+DM_COOP_INTERNET	player	`1` turns on internet play: links from any address, each proving `DM_COOP_ROOM`, every message tagged against changes (not encrypted); `join:` takes public addresses. `0` keeps `DM_COOP=auto` on the LAN (DNS-SD). Unset: on through the built-in relay when `DM_COOP=auto` has no `DM_COOP_RELAY` or `DM_COOP_JOIN`, else off
